1
00:00:00,313 --> 00:00:01,643
(Amy(in flashback):)Darn it.

2
00:00:01,648 --> 00:00:03,048
(Amy(in flashback):)There's something
in my eye,

3
00:00:03,049 --> 00:00:06,719
(Amy(in flashback):)and I need to sort
these coins by size.

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,120
(Amy(in flashback):)Can you help?

5
00:00:13,226 --> 00:00:15,496
(Amy(in flashback):)Penny?

6
00:00:15,495 --> 00:00:17,495
(Amy(in flashback):)I really want to
eat this banana,

7
00:00:17,497 --> 00:00:20,567
(Amy(in flashback):)but it's stuck inside
this bamboo puzzle box.

8
00:00:23,637 --> 00:00:26,707
Son of a bitch!

9
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:28,106
(Sheldon:)Okay, that's great.

10
00:00:28,108 --> 00:00:30,008
(Sheldon:)Now, let it go.

11
00:00:36,182 --> 00:00:39,252
(Penny:)I can't believe you were
testing me against a chimp!

12
00:00:39,252 --> 00:00:41,922
(Sheldon:)Well, excuse me,
Amy was testing you.

13
00:00:41,922 --> 00:00:44,252
(Sheldon:)I was rooting for you.

14
00:00:45,525 --> 00:00:48,765
(Sheldon:)Good job on that banana box,
by the way.

15
00:00:48,762 --> 00:00:51,532
(Sheldon:)Why would she
even do this?

16
00:00:51,531 --> 00:00:53,531
(Sheldon:)She's been conducting
an experiment on apes

17
00:00:53,533 --> 00:00:55,433
(Sheldon:)where they're given
various puzzles to solve.

18
00:00:55,435 --> 00:00:58,105
(Sheldon:)I was surprised
at the complexity of the puzzles

19
00:00:58,104 --> 00:01:00,434
(Sheldon:)and thought some humans wouldn't
be able to solve them.

